    "id": "def:negative-mixture-witness",
    "name": "Explicit two-component-uniform-mixture witness",
    "construction": "Let \\(L=53\\sqrt3/80\\), \\(F_1=(3/5)\\,\\mathrm{Unif}[-L/10,L/10]+(2/5)\\,\\mathrm{Unif}[-L,L]\\), and \\(F_2=\\mathrm{Unif}[-25\\sqrt3/43,25\\sqrt3/43]\\). In each stratum \\(s\\in\\{1,2\\}\\), allocate \\(N_{n1s}=N_{n2s}=\\lfloor n/4\\rfloor\\) units and \\(m_{nks}=\\lfloor N_{nks}/2\\rfloor\\), and set \\(B_{nksi}=F_k^{-1}((i-1/2)/N_{nks})\\). Under \\(\\mathsf P_n^{h,\\rho}\\), set \\(Y^{(h)}_{nksi}(0)=B_{nksi}\\) and \\(Y^{(h)}_{nksi}(1)=B_{nksi}+h_s/\\sqrt n\\). Before scaling, the stage-1 mixture has weights \\(3/5\\) and \\(2/5\\), supports \\([-1/10,1/10]\\) and \\([-1,1]\\), variance \\(203/1500\\), pair-spacing slope \\(53/25\\), and mean--normalized-rank covariance \\(1393/15000\\). Thus the exact array formulas yield \\(S^2_{B,n1s}\\to L^2(203/1500)=2851135/16000000\\), \\(\\lambda_{1s}=53/(25L)\\), \\(\\operatorname{Cov}(B_{1s},U^0_{1s})\\to L(1393/15000)\\), \\(\\operatorname{Var}(U^0_{1s})\\to1/12\\), \\(\\lambda_{2s}=43/(50\\sqrt3)\\), and \\(S^2_{B,n2s}\\to625/1849\\). Set \\(M_4=2\\), \\(\\rho_0=1/50\\), \\(\\alpha=1/20\\), \\(c_1=c_2=-113/100\\), \\(H=\\{(33/20,33/20)\\}\\), \\(C=(1,1)\\), and \\(J=\\{((1,1),1),((1,1),2)\\}\\). For both active pairs, \\(A=200\\sqrt5/(53\\sqrt{203})\\), \\(b_1=8/5\\), \\(b_2=43/100\\), and \\(\\kappa=1393\\sqrt5/(250\\sqrt{203})\\), with certified enclosures \\(A\\in[0.59223096280598,0.59223096280600]\\), \\(b_1\\in[1.60000000000000,1.60000000000000]\\), \\(b_2\\in[0.43000000000000,0.43000000000000]\\), \\(\\kappa\\in[0.87447639506005,0.87447639506008]\\), and \\(\\Delta\\in[-0.80693126929013,-0.80693126929009]\\).",
